This repository (https://github.com/qreative-co/filebrowser) is a modified
fork of FileBrowser Quantum v2.1.4-beta, maintained by Qreative.

Changes made by Qreative (files carry a "Qreative fork" comment where changed):
  - "Must change password at first login": the per-user requirePasswordChange
    flag is now set automatically for the bootstrap admin (created on first
    start, or reset at startup from auth.methods.password.adminPassword /
    FILEBROWSER_ADMIN_PASSWORD); while it is set, the backend answers every
    authenticated API except own-user lookup and logout with
    403 {"mustChangePassword": true}, and the web UI shows a locked prompt that
    asks for the current password and a new one (twice). Completing the change
    ends every earlier session of that user.
  - A GitHub Actions workflow that builds the image
    ghcr.io/qreative-co/filebrowser.
